0/wp-content/uploads/media/echo-echo-3-300x169.jpg\" alt=\"Rozkładówka artbooka Echo Światów\" loading=\"lazy\"></div></section>\n\n<section id=\"echo-creators\" class=\"echo-section wrap\"><span class=\"echo-kicker\">ZA OBRAZEM I DŹWIĘKIEM</span><h2>Twórcy albumu</h2><div class=\"echo-creators\"><article><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/media/echo-nikola_todoroski_2_thumb-222x300.jpg\" alt=\"Nikola Todoroski\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"echo-kicker\">Muzyka</span><h3>Nikola Todoroski</h3></article><article><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/media/echo-Katarzyna_180x208.jpg\" alt=\"Katarzyna Malinowska\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"echo-kicker\">Ilustracje</span><h3>Katarzyna Malinowska</h3></article><article><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/media/echo-Pawel_Goral.jpg\" alt=\"Paweł Góral\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"echo-kicker\">Ilustracje</span><h3>Paweł Góral</h3></article></div><div class=\"echo-writers\"><h3>Autorzy tekstów</h3><dl><div><dt>Wojtek Rzadek</dt><dd>Muzyka na sesjach RPG</dd></div><div><dt>Maciej Jesionowski</dt><dd>Ilustracje w rękach Mistrza Gry</dd></div><div><dt>Artur Kurasiński</dt><dd>Mapy na sesjach</dd></div><div><dt>Krzysztof Głośnicki</dt><dd>Przygotowanie i organizacja sesji</dd></div></dl></div></section>\n</main>",
    "en": "<main id=\"main\" class=\"echo-page\">\n<section class=\"echo-hero\"><img class=\"echo-hero-art\" src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/media/echo-Track_wiedzmy.jpg\" alt=\"\" fetchpriority=\"high\"><div class=\"echo-hero-copy\"><span class=\"echo-kicker\">AN ALBUM OF INSPIRATION · ARTBOOK + CD</span><h1>Echo<br><em>of Worlds</em></h1><p>Images you can hear. Music you can see.</p><a class=\"echo-button\" href=\"#echo-music\">Listen</a></div><span class=\"echo-hero-note\">FOR YOUR STORIES</span></section>\n<nav class=\"echo-chapters wrap\" aria-label=\"Album chapters\"><a href=\"#echo-album\">Album</a><a href=\"#echo-film\">Film</a><a href=\"#echo-music\">Music</a><a href=\"#echo-artbook\">Artbook</a><a href=\"#echo-creators\">Creators</a></nav>\n<section id=\"echo-album\" class=\"echo-album wrap echo-section\"><div><span class=\"echo-kicker\">OPEN. LISTEN. IMAGINE.</span><h2>One illustration.<br><em>A thousand stories.</em></h2><p>Echo of Worlds is an album of inspiration: an illustrated artbook and a CD of music composed for its images. The book also includes stories and articles about preparing RPG sessions. Use its images, sounds and stories during roleplaying sessions, board games, reading or creating worlds of your own.</p><a class=\"echo-text-link\" href=\"#echo-music\">Discover the album</a></div><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/media/echo-Echo-Swiatow-2.jpg\" alt=\"Echo of Worlds artbook and CD\" loading=\"lazy\"></section>\n<section id=\"echo-film\" class=\"echo-section wrap\"><span class=\"echo-kicker\">WATCH THE ALBUM</span><h2>Echo in motion.</h2><iframe class=\"echo-film\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/QCL9oalYPPc\" title=\"Echo Światów — film o albumie\" loading=\"lazy\" allow=\"encrypted-media; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen></iframe></section>\n<section id=\"echo-music\" class=\"echo-section echo-listening\"><div class=\"wrap\"><header class=\"echo-listening-heading\"><div><span class=\"echo-kicker\">A SPACE FOR LISTENING</span><h2>Choose your mood.</h2></div><p>Samples and tracks from the original album page.</p></header><div class=\"echo-track-grid\">\n<article class=\"echo-track\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/media/echo-Track_wymarsz.jpg\" alt=\"Ku przeznaczeniu\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"echo-track-copy\"><span class=\"echo-track-number\">01</span><h3>Towards destiny</h3><span class=\"echo-track-type\">TRACK</span></div><audio controls preload=\"none\" aria-label=\"Ku przeznaczeniu\"><source src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/media/echo-lurking_darkness.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\"></audio></article><article class=\"echo-track\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/media/echo-Track_karawana.jpg\" alt=\"Karawana\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"echo-track-copy\"><span class=\"echo-track-number\">02</span><h3>Caravan</h3><span class=\"echo-track-type\">SAMPLE</span></div><audio controls preload=\"none\" aria-label=\"Karawana\"><source src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/media/echo-karawana_sample.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\"></audio></article><article class=\"echo-track\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/media/echo-Track_hipnoza.jpg\" alt=\"Hipnoza\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"echo-track-copy\"><span class=\"echo-track-number\">03</span><h3>Hypnosis</h3><span class=\"echo-track-type\">SAMPLE</span></div><audio controls preload=\"none\" aria-label=\"Hipnoza\"><source src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/media/echo-hipnoza_sample.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\"></audio></article><article class=\"echo-track\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/media/echo-Track_wiedzmy.jpg\" alt=\"Wiedźmy\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"echo-track-copy\"><span class=\"echo-track-number\">04</span><h3>Witches</h3><span class=\"echo-track-type\">TRACK</span></div><audio controls preload=\"none\" aria-label=\"Wiedźmy\"><source src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/media/echo-Elekt-Witches.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\"></audio></article><article class=\"echo-track\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/media/echo-Track_dzwon.jpg\" alt=\"Żałobny Dzwon\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"echo-track-copy\"><span class=\"echo-track-number\">05</span><h3>Mourning Bell</h3><span class=\"echo-track-type\">SAMPLE</span></div><audio controls preload=\"none\" aria-label=\"Żałobny Dzwon\"><source src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/media/echo-cesarz_sample.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\"></audio></article><article class=\"echo-track\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/media/echo-Track_straznica.jpg\" alt=\"Strażnica\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"echo-track-copy\"><span class=\"echo-track-number\">06</span><h3>Watchtower</h3><span class=\"echo-track-type\">TRACK</span></div><audio controls preload=\"none\" aria-label=\"Strażnica\"><source src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/media/echo-shadow_valley.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\"></audio></article><article class=\"echo-track\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/media/echo-Track_pustkowie.jpg\" alt=\"Pustkowie\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"echo-track-copy\"><span class=\"echo-track-number\">07</span><h3>Wasteland</h3><span class=\"echo-track-type\">SAMPLE</span></div><audio controls preload=\"none\" aria-label=\"Pustkowie\"><source src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/media/echo-pustkowia_sample.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\"></audio></article><article class=\"echo-track\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/media/echo-Track_organista.jpg\" alt=\"Organista\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"echo-track-copy\"><span class=\"echo-track-number\">08</span><h3>Organist</h3><span class=\"echo-track-type\">SAMPLE</span></div><audio controls preload=\"none\" aria-label=\"Organista\"><source src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/media/echo-organista_sample.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\"></audio></article><article class=\"echo-track\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/media/echo-Track_palac.jpg\" alt=\"Pałac\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"echo-track-copy\"><span class=\"echo-track-number\">09</span><h3>Palace</h3><span class=\"echo-track-type\">SAMPLE</span></div><audio controls preload=\"none\" aria-label=\"Pałac\"><source src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/media/echo-EchoSwiatow_palac_sample.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\"></audio></article><article class=\"echo-track\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/media/echo-Track_huta.jpg\" alt=\"Huta\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"echo-track-copy\"><span class=\"echo-track-number\">10</span><h3>Foundry</h3><span class=\"echo-track-type\">SAMPLE</span></div><audio controls preload=\"none\" aria-label=\"Huta\"><source src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/media/echo-EchoSwiatow_huta_sample.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\"></audio></article></div><div class=\"echo-bonus\"><span class=\"echo-kicker\">BONUS TRACK</span><h3>Tsukuyumi</h3><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/G17AOGyh3tQ\" title=\"Echo Światów — Tsukuyumi\" loading=\"lazy\" allow=\"encrypted-media; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen></iframe></div></div></section>\n<section id=\"echo-artbook\" class=\"echo-section wrap\"><header class=\"echo-artbook-heading\"><span class=\"echo-kicker\">INSPIRATION ON PAPER</span><h2>Hold the image.<br><em>Write your own story.</em></h2><p>Artwork by Katarzyna Malinowska and Paweł Góral meets Nikola Todoroski’s music, stories and writing about RPG sessions.</p></header><div class=\"echo-artbook-gallery\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/media/echo-echo-5-300x169.jpg\" alt=\"Echo of Worlds artbook spread\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/media/echo-echo-4-300x169.jpg\" alt=\"Echo of Worlds artbook spread\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/media/echo-echo-3-300x169.jpg\" alt=\"Echo of Worlds artbook spread\" loading=\"lazy\"></div></section>\n\n<section id=\"echo-creators\" class=\"echo-section wrap\"><span class=\"echo-kicker\">BEHIND THE IMAGE AND SOUND</span><h2>Album creators</h2><div class=\"echo-creators\"><article><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/media/echo-nikola_todoroski_2_thumb-222x300.jpg\" alt=\"Nikola Todoroski\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"echo-kicker\">Music</span><h3>Nikola Todoroski</h3></article><article><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/media/echo-Katarzyna_180x208.jpg\" alt=\"Katarzyna Malinowska\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"echo-kicker\">Illustrations</span><h3>Katarzyna Malinowska</h3></article><article><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/media/echo-Pawel_Goral.jpg\" alt=\"Paweł Góral\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"echo-kicker\">Illustrations</span><h3>Paweł Góral</h3></article></div><div class=\"echo-writers\"><h3>Contributing writers</h3><dl><div><dt>Wojtek Rzadek</dt><dd>Music in RPG sessions</dd></div><div><dt>Maciej Jesionowski</dt><dd>Illustrations for the game master</dd></div><div><dt>Artur Kurasiński</dt><dd>Maps at the table</dd></div><div><dt>Krzysztof Głośnicki</dt><dd>Preparing and organizing sessions</dd></div></dl></div></section>\n</main>"
